
## Getting Started

1. **Clone the Repository**:
   ```sh
   git clone <repository-url>
   cd NetSpeedWidget
   ```

2. **Build the Project**:
   Open the solution in Visual Studio or use the .NET CLI to build the project.
   ```sh
   dotnet build
   ```

3. **Run the Application**:
   You can run the application using Visual Studio or by executing the compiled binary.
   ```sh
   bin\Debug\net8.0-windows\NetSpeedWidget.exe
   ```

